Service -> Service: 4: Resolve configured retention days for category with bounded\nfallback
Service -> Service: 5: Calculate UTC receivedAt + retentionDays
Service -> Table: 6: Persist retention_deadline with received warehouse item
activate Table
Table --> Service: 7: Stored retention deadline
deactivate Table
Service --> Page: 8: Category retention deadline
Page --> Actor: 9: Record task outcome
deactivate Service
deactivate Page
deactivate Actor

